<title>POLAND: BYTOM 1996 NET FALLS TO PLN 0.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>BYTOM 1996 NET FALLS TO PLN 0.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bytom SA preliminary results for</p>
<p>the financial year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						   1996	 1995</p>
<p>    operating profit			 8.23 vs    8.95</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   0.97 vs    4.63</p>
<p>    net profit				 0.18 vs    2.72</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Zaklady Odziezowe Bytom SA.</p>
<p>Earlier company reported net profit PLN 0.26 mln.</p>
<p>    net sales				 83.87 vs   78.11</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  66.73 vs   61.61</p>
